        }
      },
      "comment": "No comment provided by engineer."
    },
    "This item will be permanently removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此项目将被永久移除。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "No comment provided by engineer."
    },
    "This provisioning profile contains %@ developer certificate(s), but none match any signing certificates in SideStore.\n\nContinuing means this profile will not be usable for signing apps until a matching signing certificate with private key is imported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此描述文件包含 %@ 个开发者证书，但均与 SideStore 中的任何签名证书不匹配。\n\n继续操作意味着在导入匹配的带私钥签名证书之前，该描述文件将无法用于应用签名。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "No comment provided by engineer."
    },
    "This reinstallation registers the new signature with the OS and will terminate SideStore. You can reopen SideStore immediately once reinstallation is completed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此次重新安装将向系统注册新签名并终止 SideStore。重新安装完成后，您可以立即重新打开 SideStore。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "No comment provided by engineer."
    },
    "This will also erase any backup data for this app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这也将抹掉该应用的所有备份数据。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "No comment provided by engineer."
    },
    "This will clear the locally stored private key of this certificate.\n\nName: %@\nS/N: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将清除本地存储的此证书私钥。\n\n名称：%1$@\n序列号：%2$@"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "No comment provided by engineer."
    },
    "This will permanently delete all %@ provisioning profile(s) for team '%@' on Apple's developer portal. SideStore will automatically generate fresh profiles on next app install or refresh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将永久删除 Apple 开发者门户上团队“%2$@”的所有 %1$@ 个描述文件。下次安装或刷新应用时，SideStore 将自动生成新的描述文件。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "No comment provided by engineer."
    },
    "This will remove all temporary files as well as backups for uninstalled apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将移除所有临时文件以及已卸载应用的备份。"
