            "state": "translated",
            "value": "您可以编辑描述文件名称，并使用更新后的证书或设备关联重新生成该描述文件。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "No comment provided by engineer."
    },
    "You can enter SideStore, but a pairing file is required before you can install or refresh apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "您可以进入 SideStore，但在安装或刷新应用之前需要提供配对文件。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "No comment provided by engineer."
    },
    "You cannot use special characters such as @, &, *, ', \", -, .": {
